# <type>(<optional scope>): <short summary, imperative mood>
#
# Body (optional): explain what and why, not how.
# Wrap lines at ~72 characters.
#
# Footer (optional): reference issues, e.g. "Closes #12"
#
# ---- types --------------------------------------------------------
# feat:     new feature
# fix:      bug fix
# docs:     documentation only
# style:    formatting, semicolons, etc (no logic change)
# refactor: refactoring without changing behavior
# perf:     performance improvement
# test:     adding/adjusting tests
# build:    build, dependencies, Docker
# ci:       CI/CD pipelines (.github/workflows)
# chore:    miscellaneous maintenance tasks
#
# ---- suggested scopes ---------------------------------------------
# backend | frontend | desktop | mobile | infra | docs
#
# ---- example ---------------------------------------------------------
# feat(backend): add event creation endpoint
#
# Creates the POST /events endpoint, validating start/end date
# and returning 201 with the created resource.
#
# Closes #34